symbol-kind-nc-help = A contact that opens when its device is actuated.
symbol-kind-co-help = A contact whose common point changes over from one side to the other when its device is actuated.
symbol-kind-coil-help = The coil of a relay or contactor; its contacts refer to it.
symbol-kind-pole-help = A path through a device, or out of a source: a pole of a breaker, fuse or switch, a supply or an air supply.
symbol-kind-terminal-help = A terminal of a terminal strip; it is listed in the terminal diagram.
symbol-kind-plc_io-help = A channel of a PLC card; it gets an address and is listed in the PLC lists.
symbol-kind-bus_port-help = A bus port such as PROFINET or PROFIBUS; its device joins a bus net.
symbol-kind-valve-help = A fluid power valve; its ports carry air or oil, and it can sit on a valve terminal.
symbol-function-locked = Locked: a ready-made function is used. Choose None under More ▸ Ready-made function to change it.
